cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyPSA-Türkiye, please cite the paper below and the PyPSA-Earth and PyPSA references."
title: "PyPSA-Türkiye: an open-source energy system model of the Turkish power system"
abstract: >-
  PyPSA-Türkiye is an open-source, network-resolved energy system model of the
  Turkish power system that co-optimizes generation, storage and transmission
  investment with hourly operation. It is a fork of PyPSA-Earth and provides
  configurations for 7, 22, 50 and 81 clustered nodes, five policy scenarios and
  a 2023 dispatch backcast.
